commit c36c57302eeb8c520aba4744a5705f3384d607df
Author: James <jblack144@gmail.com>
Date:   2021-07-22 14:46:17 -0400

    Add chat back (#745)
    
    * Add body target button, add ability to toggle body target
    
    * Revert "Add body target button, add ability to toggle body target"
    
    This reverts commit e9d796ec9abadef8da2bb10868a4a3452f5f90cd.
    
    * Add chat icon, re-enable chat, expand / collapse chat with button
    
    * Removed vsconfig and reverted SingleColorMaterial
    
    * Change icon to white, give it a background, and make it and the chat responsive to different window sizes
    
    * Move chat's default pos over right
    
    * Add toggleChat to chat button
    
    * rename chat icon to chat, fix responsiveness for chat and inventory for consistency
    
    * Move chat button over right, fix null ref for tab creator to allow creating new chat tabs
    
    * Move chat window forward so it's on top
    
    * revert inventory and chat scaling, make chat icon bigger in button
    
    * Darken chat button when clicked
    
    * Make chat button scale properly

